{"seq":2,"slug":"expression-matrix-data-structure","title":"表达矩阵与 AnnData/Seurat 数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/singlecell-assay-data-model/expression-matrix-data-structure","wordCount":2446,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"表达矩阵与-anndata-seurat-数据模型\">表达矩阵与 AnnData/Seurat 数据模型</h1><p>单细胞数据的分析质量在第一步就被数据结构决定了：10x 实验的原始输出只是一个「基因 × 细胞」的稀疏计数表，经质控、归一化、降维、注释后会携带十几类维度不同的附属信息。如果对存储语义没有明确约定，就会出现「同一字段在不同工具里含义不同」的灾难——<code>.X</code> 在归一化前后指代的变化、Seurat v5 的 <code>data</code> 层与 <code>scale.data</code> 层的混淆，都是数据模型问题而非算法问题。本文讲清表达矩阵的物理表示，以及 AnnData 与 Seurat 如何为它建立字段级契约，并说明磁盘格式与云规模资源的对应关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从一张稀疏计数表到一个带注释的对象\">核心概念：从一张稀疏计数表到一个带注释的对象</h2><p>测序仪给出的不是「每个细胞每个基因的表达量」，而是<strong>每个液滴里每条 mRNA 分子被打到的次数</strong>。经过比对和细胞条形码（barcode）拆分后，产出的是一个计数矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M \\in \\mathbb{N}^{\\,n_{gene} \\times n_{cell}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在细胞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 中检出的 UMI 数。这个矩阵有两个统计特征决定了它的存储方式：<strong>极度稀疏</strong>（单个细胞的表达基因通常只有几千个，基因总数在两万以上），以及<strong>维度不对称</strong>（细胞数随实验规模从数千增长到百万级，基因数相对稳定）。因此主流格式都以<strong>稀疏矩阵</strong>为基础。</p>\n<p>一旦进入分析，这张裸矩阵会被反复改写：原始计数要保留以便追溯，归一化值要用于降维，批次拆分要按来源分层，质控指标、聚类标签、UMAP 坐标、差异表达结果又各自是一张维度不同的附加表。一个合格的容器必须能<strong>同时承载这些附属结构，并明确规定哪个字段在任何时刻代表什么</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[10x 液滴测序] --&gt; B[Cell Ranger 比对 + barcode 拆分]&#10;  B --&gt; C[稀疏计数矩阵&lt;br/&gt;gene x cell]&#10;  C --&gt; D[质控过滤细胞与基因]&#10;  D --&gt; E[归一化 / log1p]&#10;  E --&gt; F[高变基因选择]&#10;  F --&gt; G[缩放 / PCA / 邻居图]&#10;  G --&gt; H[聚类 / UMAP / 注释]&#10;  C -.原始计数保留.-&gt; L[layers 原始层]&#10;  G -.降维坐标.-&gt; O[obsm / reducedDims]&#10;  H -.细胞标签.-&gt; OB[obs / colData]&#10;  L --&gt; S[落盘 h5ad / rds]&#10;  OB --&gt; S&#10;  O --&gt; S\">flowchart TD\n  A[10x 液滴测序] --&gt; B[Cell Ranger 比对 + barcode 拆分]\n  B --&gt; C[稀疏计数矩阵&lt;br/&gt;gene x cell]\n  C --&gt; D[质控过滤细胞与基因]\n  D --&gt; E[归一化 / log1p]\n  E --&gt; F[高变基因选择]\n  F --&gt; G[缩放 / PCA / 邻居图]\n  G --&gt; H[聚类 / UMAP / 注释]\n  C -.原始计数保留.-&gt; L[layers 原始层]\n  G -.降维坐标.-&gt; O[obsm / reducedDims]\n  H -.细胞标签.-&gt; OB[obs / colData]\n  L --&gt; S[落盘 h5ad / rds]\n  OB --&gt; S\n  O --&gt; S</pre><blockquote>\n<p>事实锚点：AnnData 官方定义自己「位于 pandas 与 xarray 之间」，同时支持稀疏数据与惰性操作，结构包含 <code>X</code>、<code>obs</code>、<code>var</code>、<code>layers</code>、<code>obsm</code>、<code>varm</code>、<code>obsp</code>、<code>varp</code>、<code>uns</code> 与 <code>raw</code>；当前 <code>anndata</code> 版本为 0.13.3.post0（<a href=\"https://anndata.readthedocs.io/en/stable/\">anndata 文档</a>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"稀疏矩阵的物理表示-mex-三文件与-csr\">稀疏矩阵的物理表示：MEX 三文件与 CSR</h2><p>Cell Ranger 的输出目录里没有单个矩阵文件，而是三个配套文件——这是稀疏矩阵最经典的落地形式。<strong>MEX（Matrix Market Exchange）</strong> 是 NIST 定义的文本交换格式，稀疏矩阵用坐标（coordinate）表示：头部声明 <code>%%MatrixMarket matrix coordinate integer general</code>，随后一行给出「行数 列数 非零元个数」，再逐行列出「行索引 列索引 值」，且<strong>索引从 1 开始计数</strong>（<a href=\"https://math.nist.gov/MatrixMarket/formats.html\">NIST Matrix Market 格式</a>）。</p>\n<p>10x 的 <code>filtered_feature_bc_matrix</code> 目录正是这一格式的三件套：<code>matrix.mtx.gz</code> 存非零计数，<code>barcodes.tsv.gz</code> 按列顺序给出细胞条形码，<code>features.tsv.gz</code> 按行顺序给出基因 ID / 名称 / 类型。<strong>关键约束是顺序</strong>：<code>.mtx</code> 里只有数值坐标，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 列对应哪个细胞完全由 <code>barcodes.tsv.gz</code> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 行决定；三个文件缺一不可，顺序错乱即数据错位。同目录的 <code>.h5</code> 文件把三者打包为单个 HDF5，便于一次读取。</p>\n<p>在内存中，稀疏矩阵通常转换为 CSR（Compressed Sparse Row）或 CSC 格式：用 <code>data</code>（非零值）、<code>indices</code>（列索引）、<code>indptr</code>（每行起止偏移）三个数组描述，存储量正比于非零元个数而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{gene} \\times n_{cell}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。下表对比各种存储形式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MEX 三文件</td>\n<td><code>.mtx</code> + barcodes + features</td>\n<td>通用、可读、任何语言可解析</td>\n<td>工具间交换、Cell Ranger 输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HDF5 打包</td>\n<td>单个 <code>.h5</code></td>\n<td>一次读取、支持分层与压缩</td>\n<td>流水线中间产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSR / CSC</td>\n<td>data / indices / indptr</td>\n<td>内存紧凑、行或列切片快</td>\n<td>内存计算、AnnData <code>X</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘分块</td>\n<td>BPCells / TileDB</td>\n<td>超内存数据、按需读取</td>\n<td>百万级细胞骨架分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>事实锚点：CELLxGENE Census 的一个 LTS 版本为 <strong>2025-11-08</strong>，覆盖人、小鼠、猕猴、普通狨猴与黑猩猩五个物种，采用 SOMA 数据模型并由 TileDB-SOMA 实现，可返回 AnnData、Seurat 或 SingleCellExperiment 对象（<a href=\"https://chanzuckerberg.github.io/cellxgene-census/\">CZ CELLxGENE Census</a>）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"anndata-按维度分层的字段契约\">AnnData：按维度分层的字段契约</h2><p>AnnData 的设计原则是<strong>按维度划分字段</strong>，每个字段的合法形状被硬性约定，从而把「丰富注释」和「矩阵本体」解耦。理解它只需记住「行 = 细胞（observation），列 = 基因（variable）」。下表是核心字段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>承载什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>X</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{obs} \\times n_{var}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>主表达矩阵（归一化 + log1p 后的值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>obs</code> / <code>var</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{obs} \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{var} \\times k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>细胞级 / 基因级元数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>layers</code></td>\n<td>每层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{obs} \\times n_{var}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与 <code>X</code> 同形的备用矩阵（原始计数、缩放值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>obsm</code> / <code>varm</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{obs} \\times d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{var} \\times d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>细胞级 / 基因级多维数组（PCA、UMAP）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>obsp</code> / <code>varp</code></td>\n<td>前两维为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{obs}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{var}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>成对关系矩阵（邻居图、距离图）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>uns</code></td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>非结构化元数据（参数字典、配色）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>最容易出错的是「保留原始计数」的写法</strong>。规范做法是把原始计数放进 <code>layers[&quot;counts&quot;]</code>，<code>X</code> 只承载当前分析需要的那一层：质控或归一化改写 <code>X</code> 时 <code>layers</code> 里的原始值不受影响，后续做差异表达或伪时序可直接切回原始计数而不必重读磁盘。AnnData 还提供 <code>raw</code>（全基因快照）与 <code>concat</code>（对象拼接），后者带 <code>join</code> 参数决定取交集还是取并集。</p>\n<p><strong>视图与拷贝是内存陷阱</strong>。AnnData 对子集化<strong>始终返回视图</strong>（view）——视图不复制数据，只引用原对象，「不分配新内存」。但一旦修改视图上的某个属性（如给 <code>adata_subset.obs</code> 加一列），AnnData 会隐式把视图实体化（发出 <code>ImplicitModificationWarning</code>），整块矩阵被复制。因此「先切片、再逐个改 <code>obs</code>」在百万级数据上会静默地把内存翻倍；要独立对象必须显式调用 <code>.copy()</code>（<a href=\"https://anndata.readthedocs.io/en/stable/tutorials/notebooks/getting-started.html\">AnnData 入门教程</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"seurat-v5-的-assay5-按来源分层的同名层\">Seurat v5 的 Assay5：按来源分层的同名层</h2><p>R 生态的对应容器是 Seurat。v5 引入的关键变化是<strong>把 Assay 内的数据改为「层（layers）」结构</strong>：<code>counts</code> 存原始计数，<code>data</code> 存归一化值，<code>scale.data</code> 存 z-score 或方差稳定化值。这套命名与 AnnData 的 <code>layers</code> 概念同构，但语义绑定了固定的三层。</p>\n<p>v5 真正的新能力是<strong>按批次拆分同名层</strong>：传统做法是「多样本各建对象再整合」，v5 允许在同一对象内调用 <code>split()</code> 按某个 <code>obs</code>（如 <code>Method</code>）列把层拆开——官方示例一次拆分产生了 18 个层，即每个批次的 <code>counts</code> 与 <code>data</code> 各一份，各自保留归一化状态，避免「先合并再归一化」的批次污染。代价是<strong>下游操作前必须先合并</strong>：差异表达要求层结构归位，官方在拆分后、做 DE 之前会调用 <code>JoinLayers()</code> 把各层折叠回单一的 <code>counts</code> 与 <code>data</code>，之后仍可再次拆分（<a href=\"https://satijalab.org/seurat/articles/seurat5_integration.html\">Seurat v5 vignette</a>；站点当前标称 5.6.0，vignette 编译于 2026-05-22）。</p>\n<p>R 侧的另一条主线是 Bioconductor 的 <strong>SingleCellExperiment（SCE）</strong>，它继承自 SummarizedExperiment，把多个特征 × 细胞矩阵放入 <code>assays</code>，细胞注释放入 <code>colData</code>，基因注释放入 <code>rowData</code>，并新增 <code>reducedDims</code> 槽存放 PCA / t-SNE 坐标。当前版本为 <strong>1.34.0</strong>（Bioconductor 3.23），有 74 个包直接依赖它（<a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/SingleCellExperiment.html\">SingleCellExperiment</a>），常作为 R 生态中比 Seurat 更底层的交换格式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>AnnData</th>\n<th>Seurat v5 (Assay5)</th>\n<th>SingleCellExperiment</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主矩阵 / 原始计数</td>\n<td><code>X</code>；<code>layers[&quot;counts&quot;]</code></td>\n<td>默认层；<code>counts</code> 层</td>\n<td><code>assays</code> 主 assay；<code>counts</code> assay</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化 / 缩放值</td>\n<td><code>X</code> 或 <code>layers</code></td>\n<td><code>data</code> / <code>scale.data</code> 层</td>\n<td>另一 assay</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细胞元数据</td>\n<td><code>obs</code></td>\n<td><code>meta.data</code></td>\n<td><code>colData</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基因元数据</td>\n<td><code>var</code></td>\n<td><code>meta.features</code></td>\n<td><code>rowData</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降维坐标</td>\n<td><code>obsm</code></td>\n<td><code>reductions</code></td>\n<td><code>reducedDims</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"磁盘格式-h5ad-的编码约定与云规模对象\">磁盘格式：h5ad 的编码约定与云规模对象</h2><p>内存对象必须落盘才能在流水线之间传递。AnnData 的原生磁盘格式是 <strong>h5ad</strong>，本质是一个 HDF5 分组，根节点带 <code>encoding-type: anndata</code>、<code>encoding-version: 0.1.0</code> 的元数据；<code>obs</code> 与 <code>var</code> 是必需的数据框，<code>X</code> 可以是稠密数组或稀疏矩阵，<code>layers</code>、<code>obsm</code>、<code>uns</code> 各自映射为对应编码。其可靠性来自<strong>逐元素的编码类型声明</strong>：每个节点用 <code>encoding-type</code> / <code>encoding-version</code> 记录自己是什么，读取器据此正确还原类型而不是靠猜测。稠密数组编码为 <code>array</code>，稀疏矩阵编码为 <code>csr_matrix</code> / <code>csc_matrix</code>（Group 内含 <code>data</code> / <code>indices</code> / <code>indptr</code> / <code>shape</code>），数据框编码为 <code>dataframe</code>，分类变量编码为 <code>categorical</code>。这套自描述编码使跨语言、跨版本的读取不会因类型推断而静默出错（<a href=\"https://anndata.readthedocs.io/en/latest/fileformat-prose.html\">h5ad 格式规范</a>）。</p>\n<p>面向多模态，<strong>MuData/Muon</strong> 把多个 AnnData（如 RNA、ATAC、蛋白）组合到一个容器，各模态共享同一份 <code>obs</code>（细胞）索引；面向空间转录组，<strong>SpatialData</strong> 被定义为「用于单模态与多模态空间组学数据集的数据框架、模式与序列化格式」，提供 Python / R / JavaScript 实现（<a href=\"https://spatialdata.scverse.org/en/latest/\">SpatialData</a>）。当实验从「单模态单切片」走向「多模态 + 空间坐标」，数据模型的复杂度提升不在矩阵本身，而在<strong>跨模态的对齐与坐标系统的统一</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>单细胞原始数据是<strong>稀疏的基因 × 细胞计数矩阵</strong>；MEX 三文件（<code>matrix.mtx.gz</code> + <code>barcodes.tsv.gz</code> + <code>features.tsv.gz</code>）靠<strong>行序 / 列序</strong>对齐，顺序错位即数据错位。</li>\n<li>AnnData 的核心契约是<strong>按维度分层</strong>：<code>X</code> 为主矩阵，<code>layers</code> 存同形备用层（原始计数必须单独保留），<code>obs</code>/<code>var</code> 是细胞/基因注释，<code>obsm</code>/<code>varm</code> 是多维嵌入，<code>obsp</code>/<code>uns</code> 承载成对关系与非结构化元数据。</li>\n<li>AnnData 子集化<strong>返回视图</strong>，修改视图会触发隐式实体化并复制整块矩阵；要独立对象必须显式 <code>.copy()</code>——百万级数据的内存陷阱。</li>\n<li>Seurat v5 用<strong>同名层</strong>组织数据（<code>counts</code> / <code>data</code> / <code>scale.data</code>），支持按批次 <code>split()</code> 拆分、下游 DE 前用 <code>JoinLayers()</code> 合并；SCE 的 <code>assays</code>/<code>colData</code>/<code>rowData</code>/<code>reducedDims</code> 是 R 侧的交换级容器。</li>\n<li>落盘格式靠<strong>自描述编码</strong>保证可靠性：h5ad 每个元素都带 <code>encoding-type</code> / <code>encoding-version</code>，稀疏矩阵用 CSR/CSC 三数组、分类变量用 codes/categories 编码。</li>\n<li>走向多模态与空间时，MuData 共享 <code>obs</code> 索引、SpatialData 统一坐标系统；云规模的 CELLxGENE Census 用 SOMA/TileDB-SOMA 承载。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 内关于质控过滤与批次诊断见 <a href=\"quality-control-batch-diagnosis\">质控、批次效应与数据诊断</a>；矩阵进入标准化与高变基因选择的下一步见 <a href=\"../preprocessing-annotation-pipeline/normalization-hvg-model\">归一化与高变基因选择模型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"表达矩阵与 AnnData/Seurat 数据模型","id":"表达矩阵与-anndata-seurat-数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从一张稀疏计数表到一个带注释的对象","id":"核心概念-从一张稀疏计数表到一个带注释的对象"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏矩阵的物理表示：MEX 三文件与 CSR","id":"稀疏矩阵的物理表示-mex-三文件与-csr"},{"level":2,"text":"AnnData：按维度分层的字段契约","id":"anndata-按维度分层的字段契约"},{"level":2,"text":"Seurat v5 的 Assay5：按来源分层的同名层","id":"seurat-v5-的-assay5-按来源分层的同名层"},{"level":2,"text":"磁盘格式：h5ad 的编码约定与云规模对象","id":"磁盘格式-h5ad-的编码约定与云规模对象"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"单细胞测序平台与液滴文库化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/singlecell-assay-data-model/singlecell-platform-chemistry"},"next":{"title":"细胞质控、双细胞与环境 RNA 诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/singlecell-assay-data-model/quality-control-batch-diagnosis"}}